This file is a switch, not a setting.

While it exists in the repository, update.sh starts the second platform —
spp.centreespoir.ca, the Système de Prévention de Pertes for food banks and
community organisations — alongside the church platform. Delete it and push, and
the next deploy takes that site offline within two minutes.

Either way the data is kept: the container's database lives in /opt/wps/data-spp
on the VPS and is never touched by starting or stopping it.

Its DNS record (A, spp → 72.60.112.197, grey cloud) was added on 2026-09-15.
